OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding driver jailed for fatal
OL,4,ALamborghini crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who caused the death of her
OL,7,Ffriend when she lost control of a
OL,8,Frented Lamborghini and crashed into a
OL,9,Fmotorway barrier has been jailed for 10
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FMohammed Shaan Hussain, 20, died when
OL,13,FHumaira Batool crashed the #200,000
OL,14,Fsupercar on the M62, near Ripponden, in
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire, in December 2022,
OL,16,Fcausing it to burst into flames.
OL,18,FDuring her trial, the jury heard
OL,19,FBatool, 26, from Bradford, had been
OL,20,Fdriving at speeds of up to 140mph
OL,21,F(230km/h) in wet conditions prior to
OL,22,Fthe collision.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
